    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d575">

                <pb facs="0771" n="689" xml:id="pg689"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Romero to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexican Legation</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1866-02-22"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 22, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Romero presents his respects to Mr. Seward, and has the honor to transmit to
                    him a copy of extracts of a letter he has received from Paris, dated the 3d
                    instant, and written by a reliable person, noticing the departure of forces from
                    Oran for Mexico about the end of January last.</p>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d575-a1.xml" xpointer="d575-a1"/>
